<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Paging Network rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Paging Network rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst Mark Roberts initiated coverage of Paging Network Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said expects the company to earn $2.51 a share before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization in fiscal 1996, and $3.17 EBITDA in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>-- set a price target on the stock of $30, or about 48 percent above current levels.</p>
</text>
